<urn:usf:requirement:bootstrap-carrier-current-postimage> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "For every included path, independently derive the carrier postimage and current repository postimage SHA-256 digest and mode and bind their exact currentness disposition. Historical adoption does not require current equality: a stale or reconstructable path keeps the adoption explicitly non-current and non-complete, and only a later ordinary graph-defined chain may establish present-state realization. Excluded effects remain bound as excluded and cannot become adopted bytes." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:bootstrap-carrier-authority-validation> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:bootstrap-carrier-authority-validation> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Bind the exact integration authority named graph and digest, selected manifest path and digest, authority/currentness dependency digest, selected carrier-adoption resource digest, path-effect-set resource digest and every graph-declared validation identity, dependency and result digest; caller claims and Git metadata alone are never authority." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:bootstrap-carrier-receipt-promotion> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:bootstrap-carrier-receipt-promotion> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Prepare one schema-valid content-bound receipt under ignored repository-local state, rederive and read back every field, then atomically publish the same exact bytes under the tracked receipt root only after success. A local preparation receipt is non-authoritative and a refusal never writes tracked evidence." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:bootstrap-carrier-noncompletion> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:bootstrap-carrier-noncompletion> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Adoption preserves direct-bootstrap/manual lineage and authorizes only the exact bounded historical carrier classification. It cannot create ordinary candidates, checked-candidate receipts, integration observations, completion evidence or proof, and performs no GitHub, push, provider, runtime, staging or production effect." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
