<urn:usf:requirement:integration-short-lived-worktree> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Prepare, validate and recheck the exact candidate in a repository-local short-lived Git worktree that has an independently verified Git root, exact starting carrier and bounded lifecycle; never mutate from a copied nonrepository tree." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-primary-mutation-lock> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-primary-mutation-lock> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Hold one narrow repository-local primary-mutation lock only across the final currentness recheck and atomic local carrier mutation; keep candidate preparation, validation, evidence, proof, publication, push and remote operations outside the critical section." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-scrubbed-git-boundary> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-scrubbed-git-boundary> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Run Git in a scrubbed child with hooks disabled, signing disabled, clean and smudge filters disabled, credential helpers and askpass disabled, a minimal environment and network unavailable; fail closed if any inherited configuration can execute code, reveal credentials or contact a remote." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-crash-safe-retry> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-crash-safe-retry> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Use deterministic request and observation identities, write ignored state atomically with exact readback, make an already-matching postimage an idempotent retry outcome, and fail closed on partial, conflicting or stale carrier state without destructive rollback." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-observation-only> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-observation-only> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Integrate emits only an ignored content-bound IntegrationObservation. Evidence admission, proof, tracked completion-receipt publication and any later completion transition remain separate registered stages and cannot be inferred from integration success." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-observation-authority-binding> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-observation-authority-binding> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Bind the scoped integration-authority dependency digest, exact algorithm IRI, version and current resource digest, selected integration manifest identity and byte digest, explicit versioned profile and current checked-candidate, cohort-member and integration-observation schema dependency digests. Recompute all authority fields from the selected graph and files; caller values cannot establish authority." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-observation-conditional-outcome> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:requirement:integration-observation-conditional-outcome> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Canonical requestDigest and observationDigest membership is graph-declared and excludes each digest field from its own preimage. Success requires exact integrated tree, observed carrier, independently derived postimage basis and postimage validations and forbids refusalReason. Refusal requires a stable refusalReason and forbids every integrated-tree, observed-carrier, postimage-basis and postimage-validation field so failure cannot fabricate a postimage." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
